    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Intro_01-1",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: Again we visit these ancient tombs...",
      "source_hash": "b7eaa5c2b8a7b15588ae77927cf9d458e91e6ab6b09140ba5f0f8eb0f7256c54",
      "entry_hash": "54e0593eebc636ec949f5dccfc015884b48470336300ae41b26f615872d0d920",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Intro_01-2",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: ...this time to corrupt the souls of the fallen, and to turn the land against the remaining sons of Arnor.",
      "source_hash": "e7dbda6a593b90e83644d683348e7e06a497bdb4eb2758e820ba79c578b03755",
      "entry_hash": "786fef284e859303780f0bf7aec534aa89b320d3941c1bfcafc230a0848deb81",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Intro_02-1",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: Our Sorcerers must stand atop the barrows in order to taint the graves beneath.",
      "source_hash": "579473799686905d26a659cfca8b52971485d245bc14edc5ef4b290af20f4e65",
      "entry_hash": "7b51f60a476f3d7b609fecdaa90ad26142be765e921e5df595a98dd31c3586be",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Intro_02-2",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: However, time is short.",
      "source_hash": "8163ac689c8e4d18f64678737ded4816034e19230331f256abb1527f310219d4",
      "entry_hash": "a44856df08770b48d86cd6b88e91a3efdeccea47a872aacb7fa47fbfe192c2ca",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Intro_02-3",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: We will need to hold as many barrows as possible to complete the ritual before the new day's sun rises.",
      "source_hash": "0836208f712af92eabd4265c654ce6c2df7ee65350b0efbca6260f859c8c80bb",
      "entry_hash": "7d792037b5268854876edf9bed7e8c7e9db1068a37e544f6673406874518060c",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Help_01",
      "source": "Call reinforcements!",
      "source_hash": "fb22689511cf5b33fd520d08788b62e4bed0d464f7ccfc3dfb38b38dc69e262f",
      "entry_hash": "384e04896bdef6df356816d29e13e2fd1e0d46e820b04291edaa933229521ab1",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Help_02",
      "source": "Send word - we need more men!",
      "source_hash": "a997bb94a718052abf2ad07955d443575b65884689c6d989abc576835fc6a721",
      "entry_hash": "062822826514d25b1a8ee852dbc3e132d831b89af097cd7b7a4f0d1c22cbfdc7",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_Help_03",
      "source": "We are hard pressed - we must have aid!",
      "source_hash": "90f75ea68b8b75501014d79aa84a62fb1e1ea5eba190e7654e7fdff8f00a3606",
      "entry_hash": "1254194b5bed32ef388f1bd5dbb2bc81e8a4543728e7657fe97bf51178442f94",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_CarthaenSpawn_01",
      "source": "CAPTAIN CARTHAEN: You dishonored the souls of our fathers once atop these hallowed grounds. \\n I will not suffer your foul presence again!",
      "source_hash": "8a020e53d35ea9d5adfbcd369486419b64617731b2ef816153da8e338e958c22",
      "entry_hash": "ac3e5aacbd79a8236be397d878aca5de4c56ab8792efc3e553d456f52e5a4ced",
      "protected_tokens": [
        "\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_CarthaenFlee_01",
      "source": "CAPTAIN CARTHAEN: I must gather more forces to purge your stench from this land.",
      "source_hash": "6dec25926da56431a789f81634569d23f5975d6fedae6edd5782e358bf64ce27",
      "entry_hash": "0649d875986fa8937a0de3f973e1f85ef9154e1ce8f401ce1b16e4569f1de0ba",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_CarthaenSpawn_04",
      "source": "CAPTAIN CARTHAEN: Begone filth! I will not let you taint the spirits of our kings.",
      "source_hash": "e69d43d8784dc8d03adb6a4fb8baf3f8b80b936d4c1fd3fb9d6def0b85290472",
      "entry_hash": "a7bf1e530f2427f8ab82086ef3a3c653f10a7c6a503224cd71fcd6d25ea6a67a",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_AngOff_CarthaenSpawn_04",
      "source": "ANGMAR OFFICER: The Captain of Arnor has proven a worthy and persistent adversary.\\nForget the mouldering spirits of Arnor's pathetic kings.\\nLet us reward Captain Carthaen by completing the ritual with his soul instead!",
      "source_hash": "83d3021409ebe25416ee852faf1cd2fddff07daacca053b64ca7500cdf39719d",
      "entry_hash": "6a6a56633a86e7e14dc67c993306ac9c67b70a85d6bb8c1bf7d6c34cbf736dec",
      "protected_tokens": [
        "\\n",
        "\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_FinalCutScene_Carthaen_01",
      "source": "CAPTAIN CARTHAEN: I do not fear you. You can only kill me.",
      "source_hash": "d430defe24bee3d842bdbff5e28c0028c829fe970062a280c1784bd2a5f89b31",
      "entry_hash": "a653008d34798e49af295e38f0a5d5873a6283c2eaac18e670c85fc569098f92",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_FinalCutScene_Morgomir_01",
      "source": "MORGOMIR: <Laughing>",
      "source_hash": "9c006fd7e8466069c0a116e1c3fd43311210bb09ef094901ba7de2648355a3c2",
      "entry_hash": "30d3fda3d07b4cbcc6828f8eef455a5db4cebfd8840e48a407048ae9e44d5677",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_FinalCutScene_Morgomir_02",
      "source": "MORGOMIR: How perfect is this man's punishment.",
      "source_hash": "7cf08eb2bb6dce4a601a54bf3efa6d1075090b82f48cfc1fc92f88fbc8981a74",
      "entry_hash": "e911ceabe8cacf474094da353a89a850015eee50c29b9b2b4f554c8d97d73873",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGMAR_BarrowWights_FinalCutScene_Morgomir_03",
      "source": "MORGOMIR: His dedication in life will be matched only by his devotion after death.",
      "source_hash": "dff7ae81c9b5502c943af2fde8f7f9799bc65c55f93bdc755591a727cddb0bab",
